# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# DocSense Complete Environment Configuration Reference
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# ALL AVAILABLE CONFIGURATION OPTIONS
# Copy to .env and customize for your deployment
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PostgreSQL Database Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Database credentials - CHANGE IN PRODUCTION
POSTGRES_DB=docsense
POSTGRES_USER=docsense
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=docsense_secure_password_change_in_production

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Go API Service Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Application environment: development, staging, production
APP_ENV=production

# HTTP server port
HTTP_PORT=8080

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Database Connection
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Inside Docker: use service name "postgres"
# Outside Docker: use "localhost" or IP address
DB_HOST=postgres
DB_PORT=5432
DB_USER=docsense
DB_PASSWORD=docsense_secure_password_change_in_production
DB_NAME=docsense
DB_SSLMODE=disable

# Advanced database pool settings (optional)
# DB_MAX_OPEN_CONNS=25
# DB_MAX_IDLE_CONNS=25
# DB_CONN_MAX_LIFETIME=30m
# DB_CONN_MAX_IDLE_TIME=5m

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# File Storage
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Directory for uploaded files (must be persistent volume in Docker)
STORAGE_DIR=/data

# Maximum upload size in bytes (default: 25MB)
MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES=26214400

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# RAG Service Integration
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Inside Docker: use service name "rag"
# Outside Docker: use "localhost:8000"
RAG_SERVICE_URL=http://rag:8000
RAG_SERVICE_TIMEOUT=60s

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Python RAG Service Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Application environment
RAG_ENV=production
RAG_PORT=8000

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Qdrant Vector Database
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Inside Docker: use service name "qdrant"
# Outside Docker: use "localhost:6333"
QDRANT_URL=http://qdrant:6333

# Optional: Qdrant API key for authentication
QDRANT_API_KEY=

# Collection configuration
QDRANT_COLLECTION=docsense_chunks
QDRANT_VECTOR_SIZE=384

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Embedding Model
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Uses HuggingFace sentence-transformers
# Model must produce 384-dimensional vectors
EMBEDDING_MODEL=sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM Provider Configuration
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Supported providers: "openai", "gemini", "local"
# Use "local" to disable LLM and return raw context only
LLM_PROVIDER=gemini

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION A: Google Gemini (Recommended)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE

# Available models:
# - gemini-2.0-flash-exp (fastest, experimental)
# - gemini-1.5-flash (fast, stable)
# - gemini-1.5-pro (most capable)
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash-exp

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION B: OpenAI (Alternative)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment and set if using OpenAI instead of Gemini
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Optional: OpenAI-compatible API base URL (for proxies, Azure, etc.)
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Reranker Configuration
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Reranker improves retrieval quality by re-scoring chunks
# Disable if you need faster responses
RERANKER_ENABLED=true
RERANKER_MODEL=cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Context Budget & Retrieval
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Maximum tokens to use for context (including retrieved chunks)
MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS=4000

# Maximum number of chunks to retrieve
MAX_CHUNKS=10

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Qdrant Vector Database (Standalone Service)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Optional: Enable API key authentication
# QDRANT__SERVICE__API_KEY=your_secret_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Frontend (Vite React) Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# API proxy target for development
# Inside Docker: use service name "api:8080"
# Outside Docker: use "localhost:8080"
VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://api:8080

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Firebase Authentication (Optional)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank to run without authentication (dev mode)
# Get Firebase config from: https://console.firebase.google.com/
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

# Optional Firebase settings
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DEPLOYMENT MODES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (Docker Compose)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Use service names: postgres, qdrant, api, rag
# DB_HOST=postgres
# QDRANT_URL=http://qdrant:6333
# RAG_SERVICE_URL=http://rag:8000
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://api:8080

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# PRODUCTION (Single VM)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Use localhost since services are on same machine
# DB_HOST=localhost
# QDRANT_URL=http://localhost:6333
# RAG_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Frontend served by nginx, API proxied

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# CLOUD (Distributed Services)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Use external hostnames/IPs
# DB_HOST=postgres.example.com
# DB_SSLMODE=require
# QDRANT_URL=https://qdrant.example.com
# QDRANT_API_KEY=secure_key_here
# RAG_SERVICE_URL=https://rag.example.com

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# COMMON CONFIGURATIONS BY USE CASE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# USE CASE 1: Student Demo (No LLM)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM_PROVIDER=local
# RERANKER_ENABLED=false
# (System returns raw context snippets)

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# USE CASE 2: Quick Prototype (Gemini Free Tier)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
# MAX_CHUNKS=5
# RERANKER_ENABLED=false

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# USE CASE 3: Production (High Quality)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-pro
# RERANKER_ENABLED=true
# MAX_CHUNKS=15
# MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS=8000

# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# USE CASE 4: Enterprise (OpenAI)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
# RERANKER_ENABLED=true
